Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能和天使交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you talk to angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能偷听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just overhear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于知道恶魔们为什么那么想你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know why the demons want you so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是尤瑞尔  一位专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is uriel, a specialist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又见到你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不认识我了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱里我们可走的很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were so close... in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们来了  -到里屋去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming. back room!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这里是为了安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here for anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是来帮助她的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她必须得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way. whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道她偷听你们天使聊天什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know she's wiretapping your angel chats or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这也不是让你们俩个送她归西的理由啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's no reason to gank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  我会让她平静的死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'll kill her gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真他妈的冷血知道不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're some heartless sons of bitches, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么废话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anna's an innocent girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一点也不无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is far from innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她比这个魔鬼小妞更不值得你们在她身上浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means she's worse than this abomination you've been screwing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在把她交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give us the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试吧 你个傻叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try jdate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁能阻止我们  你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna stop us? you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么这个恶魔婊子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or this demon whore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, stop...please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等这刻很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:16.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们走了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they -- are they gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他们传送走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent them away...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能告诉我怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脑子里突然出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just popped in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得安娜越来越不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think anna's getting more interesting by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说"她不是无辜的"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did they mean by "she's not innocent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是想要她死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like they want her bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.64,0:03:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是因为那天使热线的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not just 'cause of the angel radio thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想 那个血咒什么的 这事挺严重的 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that blood spell -- some serious crap, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她身上一定发生过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's going on with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-试试你能查到什么  -你打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what you can find out. what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜也许把天使送到很远  但迟早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna may have sent the angels to the outfield, but, sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get ourselves safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁墙中间含盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron walls drenched in salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们别想进来这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons can't even touch the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一下  这是种族歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I find racist, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写信给你的国会议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write your congressman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔咒袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}X bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,额外保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra-crunchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我们躲过天使恶魔和所有来访者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll hide us from angels, demons, all comers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  天使热线有没有播放一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anna, what's playing on angel radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有用的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一片死寂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not troubling at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会有麻烦么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in trouble, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.89,0:04:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到了 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her. she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在多米尼加\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dominican.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说我们弄坏任何东西都要赔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said we break anything, we buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:04:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在工作  -我希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's working a job? god, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然骗我们在外面穿性感内裤鬼混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, he's at hedonism in a banana hammock and a trucker cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's seared in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于安娜 有什么发现没\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find on anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她父母叫瑞奇和艾米 米尔顿  一个教会执事的和家庭主妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her parents were rich and amy milton -- a church deacon and a housewife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听起来不错 -不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riveting. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但报告的这里说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is something here in the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这不是她第一次闹剧  -什么不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out this latest psych episode wasn't her first. no?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当她2岁半的时候  他爸一靠近她  他就发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she was 2 1/2, she'd get hysterical any time her dad got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她认定那不是他亲身父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was convinced that he wasn't her real daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁才是  那个水管工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was? the plumber, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管道工的阳物?（黄色笑话）\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little snaking the pipes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的疑惑又联想到色情的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you're confusing reality with porn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, anna didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只是说他真正的父亲很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just kept repeating that this real father of hers was mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常生气  那种气到要杀她的程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very mad -- like wanted-to-kill-her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对2岁的孩子太严重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of heavy for a 2-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她去看了儿童心理医生  并一点点好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she saw a kid's shrink, got better, and grew up normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到现在  她隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now. so, what's she hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你们不直接问我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just ask me to my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看她看的真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm watching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're right, anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么要告诉我们的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you want to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使说你有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels said you were guilty of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.36,0:06:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我我的生活为什么会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why my life has been leveled...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我的父母会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why my parents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我做什么都好  我也很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give anything to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们查个水落石出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样查\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela. hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -是我  萨姆 \N{\fnArial\fs30}-Sam. -it's me. it's sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Sam? -yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 是你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我怎么认出你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know how I can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的小屁屁告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That perky little ass of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用它都能弹硬币玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could bounce a nickel off that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然知道是你  臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I know it's you, grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还知道那是个恶魔  还有可怜的小安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same way I know that's a demon, and that poor girl's anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还一直看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you've been eyeing my rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat it, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我比一般人敏感多了  -确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I still got more senses than most. -You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  我是帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you? I'm pamela.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩已经把发生的事告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean told me what's been going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm excited to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. that's nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能把天使揪出来  任何机会我都不放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance I can dick over an angel, I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们从我身上偷走了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stole something from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔眼  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon-y, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过它们是塑料的  这样比较好做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're just plastic. good for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人觉得我有特殊灵力  你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me look extra-psychic, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让你自己告诉我发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...how about you tell me what your deal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躺好放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我开始倒数5秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm going to count down from five to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我数到0  你就进入深度睡眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're at zero, you'll be in a deep state of hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒数的时候  越来越深  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I count down, just go deeper and deeper, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}5...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:07:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}4...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}3...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}2...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松每一寸肌肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every muscle calm and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能听到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  安娜  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, anna, tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么听到天使讲话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you hear the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时是怎么施法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you work that spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇·米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再往前回想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want you to look further back...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were very young...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几岁大的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  看一下就好  我们想要的就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, just one look -- that's all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your dad's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的亲生父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your real dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么冲你发火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he angry at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静  他会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. he's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-安娜  -迪恩  别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Anna? -dean, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来  1  2  3  4  5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake in 1, 2, 3, 4, 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, pamela.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That helped a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想起了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被雷到了 你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bite. who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕  我和别人不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.i'm not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't find that very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do i.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  卡西迪奥和尤瑞尔 他们是来找我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...castiel, uriel -- they're the ones that came for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were kind of in the same foxhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是你老大或者其他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, they're like your bosses or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.96,0:10:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反过来想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可现在他们想杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now they want to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命令就是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders are orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确定我被判了死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I have a death sentence on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抗命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disobeyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们来说  这是最严重的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, for us, is about the worst thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她落到地上  变成人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fell to earth, became human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使能变成人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, angels can just become human?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有些痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kind of hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和用刀把肾割下来的感觉差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try cutting your kidney out with a butter knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我剥离了我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ripped out my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有它就会掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hacked it out and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈  艾米  没法怀孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother, amy, couldn't get pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总说我是她的奇迹小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always called me her little miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不知道她说的有多贴切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had no idea how right she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你只是忘了你是上帝手下的特种部队 \N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you just forgot that you were god's little power ranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活得越久 我就越以为自己是人类 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The older I got, the longer I was human, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你们还没意识到我们创了个多大的祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you all appreciate how completely screwed we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比是对的 天堂那边想让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby's right. heaven wants me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而地狱只是想得到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hell just wants her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个可以审问的 折磨的 活生生的天使 我同情你 \N{\fnArial\fs30}A flesh-and-blood angel that you can question, torture, that bleeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐们儿 你就是那耀眼的斯坦利杯（北美职业冰联盟总冠军）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister, you're the stanley cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且不管天堂还是地狱 迟早他们都会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sooner or later, heaven or hell, they're gonna find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我要把它还回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I'm gonna get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能那么做吗 如果我能找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that? if I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢 那你要抽神赐的大麻 然后施展魔咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're just gonna take some divine bong hit, and, shazam,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为自己是罗玛·唐尼（主演《我和天使有个约会》）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're roma downey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我喜欢这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I like this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你的那些能量在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's this grace of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的时候弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost track.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我坠落的速度大概每小时1万英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was falling about 10,000 miles per hour at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你是说坠落 就像我们常说得那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. you mean falling, like, literally?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像人类经常可以看到的方式吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the way a human eye can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是一个彗星或是流星吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a comet maybe or a meteor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.03,0:12:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:17.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,85年3月\N{\fnArial\fs30}In march '85,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一颗流星消失在俄亥俄州西北部的夜空\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meteorite vanished in the night sky over northwestern ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那出现得比安娜出生的早9个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sighted nine months before anna was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且就出生在俄亥俄的那个地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was born in that part of ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是针强心剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty buff for a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想吧 我想那就是安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I think it was anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且在这里 同一时间 肯塔基出现另一颗流星\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here, same time -- another meteor over kentucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是她的能量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's her grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.70,0:12:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是把范围缩小到了一个州\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just narrows it down to an entire state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想吧 这只是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...i'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你带来这个大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}For bringing you this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我早知道 我一定会闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had known, I would have kept my trap shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们会对付过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we'll muddle through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次恐怕不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想夹在这两方之间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want to get between these two armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是哥斯拉和巨蛾（1964年的电影）\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's godzilla and mothra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使一方找不到我们 另一方也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one side doesn't get us, the other one will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 你想怎么做 丢下安娜自己跑路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want to do? dump anna and run?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道天使们把你惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know the angels freak you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘了那些天使吧 我真正怕的是那个阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the angels. it's alastair I'm scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔 你在教堂里见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair? you met him in the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上是地狱里来的傲慢的判官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practically the grand inquisitor downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使剃刀的毕加索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picasso with a razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你应该把他揪出来 丢回到他来的地方...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should pull him out and throw him back in the pit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是你变得那么虚弱 露比...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't so out of shape. ruby...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你的能力 你正在变得虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your abilities -- you're getting flabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我该如何恢复能力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so how do I tone up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我再也不要那么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not doing that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你最好祈祷安娜可以找回她的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you better prr pray that anna gets her groove back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉回家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela get home okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 她说她很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. she said she was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是从上一次开始 她 就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just after last time, she, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切对她来说太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a little too rich for her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys should do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not that smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你些问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想让我做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们没有说起过这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels aren't talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那是我坠落之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was after I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会坠落呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要成为我们中的一员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want to be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群卑劣的低等动物...\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of miserable bastards...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭 拉屎 迷惑 恐惧 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating, crapping, confused, afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里还有忠诚...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's loyalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宽容...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgiveness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-痛苦 -巧克力蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pain. chocolate cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-罪恶 -性爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilt. sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你找对人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各种情感 迪恩 即使是不好的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every emotion, dean, even the bad ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...这就是我坠落的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it's why I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我要放弃一切也不要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I'd give anything not to have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你问我 我会说你高估了那些感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feelings are overrated, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比做天使好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats being an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们充满力量而且完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are powerful and perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不怀疑你自己或是上帝或是任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't doubt yourselves or god or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个大理石的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a marble statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冰冷的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有选择的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 你知道有多少天使真正见过上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do you know how many angels have actually seen god?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.93,0:16:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到他的脸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们全部都见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有四个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我不是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:21.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你们怎么知道究竟存不存在上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how do you even know that there is a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to take it on faith...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们不相信  我们会被杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we are killed if we don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我驻扎在人间2000年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stationed on earth 2,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是 看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...watching...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silent...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远都在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out on the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厌倦故乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick for home...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远都在等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting on orders
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自那个我无法了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from an unknowable father
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道存不存在的上帝的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't begin to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要告诉我 有什么好笑的  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't tell me that -- what is so funny? what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:16:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这种感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.43,0:17:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤宁，肯塔基州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Union, kentucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到一些关于当地奇幻事件的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found some accounts of a local miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1985年  小镇外有一片空地\N{\fnArial\fs30}In '85, there was an empty field outside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,6个月之后变成了茂密的橡树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months later, there was a full-grown oak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说那些橡树看起来至少有1000年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it looks a century old at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被它撞到的地方  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Where it hit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会发生这样类似的事情  很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could have done something like that, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以当你的力量砸到地面 \N{\fnArial\fs30}So grace ground zero
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会造成破坏  这是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not destruction. it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百分百的创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一个天使和一个魔鬼同时坐在后座\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an angel and a demon riding in the backseat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是一个故意安排的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the setup to a bad joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是色情小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a penthouse forum letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,色情文学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你称这个是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的能量就是降落到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where the grace touched down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  你到底是在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, what are we even looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不再这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经不在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人把它拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说我们回那个避难所吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we head back to the panic room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  难道永远都躲在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想得太大声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just thinking out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说刚才那叫思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you call that thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! hey, hey, hey. stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜的能量不见了  你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna's grace is gone. you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能变成天使  她不能保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't angel up. she can't protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不可能同时与天堂和地狱交战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't fight heaven and hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个一个来也许还行  但是不能同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}One side maybe, but not both. not at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使又在说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels are talking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇怪...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是录音...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a recording...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是循环的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 温彻斯特在午夜前把安娜给我们  否则...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "dean winchester gives us anna by midnight, or..."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们把它丢回地狱的深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"or we hurl him back to damnation."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有什么武器对天使有效吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know of any weapon that works on an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么  杀了他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what? to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有办法...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing we could get to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.33,0:20:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  等等  我说我们打电话给鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait, wait. I say we call bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他回来  不要在外面风流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get him back from hedonism.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他能知道什么我们还不知道的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's he gonna tell us that we don't already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  但是我们总得想点什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but we got to think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding up okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正努力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点害怕  我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little scared, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.73,0:20:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们  你们本不用帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys -- you didn't have to help me -- hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说些"谢谢你""努力了"的话了  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's can the "thanks for trying" speech, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么屌忙都没帮上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Participation trophies suck ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不该得到救赎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't deserve to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抗命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disobeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法也抗命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer disobeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们最大的死罪  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our murder one, and I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我必须偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I got to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  好吧  每个人都干过需要付出代价的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we've all done things we got to pay for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约一个礼拜前  我听到天使在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a week ago, I heard the angels talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在地狱的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.43,0:21:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该原谅你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜  我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna, I don't w-want to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是当你能说的时候 \N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you can
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身边有想要帮你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have people that want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是所有我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I'm trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们在人间的最后一晚上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our last night on earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抢了我的拿手戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stealing my best line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}i'm walking down this rocky road
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}wondering where my life is leading
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}rolling on to the bitter end
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}i'm finding out along the way 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.50,0:23:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}what it takes to keep love living 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}you should know how it feels,my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}oooh 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}i want you to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}oooh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.16,0:23:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}i want you today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}i'm ready for love 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}oh, baby, i'm ready for love 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}ready for love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}oh, baby, i'm ready for love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}oh-oh-oh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:24:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnArial\fs30}for your love 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.33,0:25:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.03,0:25:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不说  看到你在人间的这副样子还真是意外啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say, I'm surprised to find you out in the open like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.53,0:25:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.70,0:25:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正逢乱世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looking for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.46,0:25:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那愚蠢人类朋友把这给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gawky human friend gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.06,0:25:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自个儿留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来聊聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.03,0:25:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聊什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.53,0:25:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有关恶魔怎么保护天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how a demon is protecting an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真该把你除名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really must revoke your membership.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道这几月未能尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know I'm not employee of the month,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这趟浑水  我真不想搅进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this -- I never wanted to get in the middle of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为啥在这儿呢  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.83,0:25:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把天使交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.43,0:25:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.23,0:25:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做为交换呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.30,0:25:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有温彻斯特俩兄弟  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and the winchester boys, both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.36,0:26:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使的事不关我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This angel business is none of our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.20,0:26:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早听说过你是个奸诈胆小的小泼妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd always heard that you were a devious, cowardly little slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百闻不如一见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.13,0:26:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你意下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.43,0:26:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.60,0:26:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prudent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.23,0:26:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.76,0:26:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来还个价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make you a...counteroffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.76,0:26:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子穿上衣服还真是可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so cute when monkeys wear clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming, aren't i?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.70,0:26:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从你像胆小鬼似的躲起来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way we could chat...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.96,0:27:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们唯一能进行交流的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're hiding like cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.40,0:27:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得看见你独行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't normally see you off leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.23,0:27:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老大呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.30,0:27:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  他也有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he has this weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.73,0:27:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's up, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.23,0:27:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交出女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.00,0:27:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做是我就不会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't try that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.63,0:27:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  她重获能量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, she got her grace back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.66,0:27:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是风韵十足的天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full-blown angel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.90,0:27:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道我还握着她的能量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be a neat trick, considering...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.33,0:27:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i have her grace right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能让地狱得到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let hell get their hooks into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.66,0:27:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  为啥你不把天使能量还给她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why don't you just give her back her angel juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她犯了重罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}She committed a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  就因为她自己着想了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? thinking for herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的事  不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our business, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某种意义上讲她还不能算是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not even human... not technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.56,0:27:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我猜自己只是个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I guess I just like being a pain in the pooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.56,0:28:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把自己变成\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut yourself a slice of...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.06,0:28:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一块蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel food cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.53,0:28:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.60,0:28:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.03,0:28:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你担心什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.20,0:28:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不过是个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're junkless down there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a ken doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.83,0:28:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.96,0:28:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-交出女孩  不然  -不然怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the girl, or -- or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.63,0:28:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样  你要把我扔回地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you're gonna toss me back in the hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.03,0:28:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少唬弄人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不信试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可比有关你的计划来的重要的多  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a whole lot bigger than the plans we got for you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可被取代\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.60,0:28:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只管放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.46,0:29:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定要回地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just crazy enough to go, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.30,0:29:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能说什么  我绝不轻易妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I don't break easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.13,0:29:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.13,0:29:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是该清楚哪里才能撒野\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to know where to apply the right pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.80,0:29:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道你们这代人的问题在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the problem with your generation?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.23,0:29:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太易于满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instant gratification.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.40,0:29:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注重现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all now, now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.73,0:29:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无耐心  没有技艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}No patience, no craftsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.96,0:29:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的这把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This knife of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.30,0:29:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是件好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an exquisite piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must tell me where you found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.53,0:30:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.03,0:30:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自去波特兰以来 我好久没来这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been up here since poland '43.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.66,0:30:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我厌恶这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I loathe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.43,0:30:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寒心的很啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.66,0:30:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有血腥味  鲜肉的滋滋声  剥皮后的湿粘\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stink of blood or sizzle of flesh or the wet flap of flayed skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.16,0:30:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道你怎么忍受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.26,0:30:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你越早合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the sooner you cooperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.55,0:30:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就越早解决这恐怖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner I can finish up with this ghastly 
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.22,0:30:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使任务  回家修行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel business and return home to my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.13,0:30:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.93,0:30:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来好好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take our time...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,品味这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relish the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.70,0:30:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我要移开这个 别和我词不达意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm going to remove this, but don't you go smoking out of that meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.36,0:30:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得逞不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.63,0:30:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你来告诉我天使在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you tell me where that angel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.00,0:31:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.13,0:31:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.00,0:31:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一告诉你  你就会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.33,0:31:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不明白  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.20,0:31:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.90,0:31:33.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可是你的地狱密友啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, she's your hell buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.73,0:31:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在喝酒有点早  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little early for that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某处现在才是凌晨两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 2:00 a.m. somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.66,0:31:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.36,0:31:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.06,0:32:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.30,0:32:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.53,0:32:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是他们让他做得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they gave him a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.26,0:32:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要么杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They either kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.76,0:32:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么就杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.36,0:32:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们是如何打如意算盘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how their minds work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.13,0:32:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的选择是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the best you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.70,0:33:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会责怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会再有诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.96,0:33:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会再逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more running.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.05,0:33:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.00,0:33:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:35.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不需要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.16,0:33:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不懂感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.96,0:33:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少  我们曾经经历的那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, we have a history.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这只是  -命令就是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's just - orders are orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.90,0:33:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.03,0:33:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请快点动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想碰那个可怜的姑娘一根头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch a hair on that poor girl's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.43,0:34:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么敢进这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you come in this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.86,0:34:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你活得不耐烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pussing sore?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.90,0:34:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真粗俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name-calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.53,0:34:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太伤害我的感情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt my feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.10,0:34:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们假装神圣  其实是狂热的激进份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sanctimonious, fanatical prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.30,0:34:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在马上转身离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around and walk away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.46,0:34:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  只要给我们那个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. just give us the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.83,0:34:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们保证会让她得到应有的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make sure she gets punished good and proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.43,0:34:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们是谁  更知道我们的能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who we are and what we will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.43,0:34:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会重复第二次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.10,0:34:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.30,0:34:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们就废了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we lay you to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.93,0:34:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我想冒险试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I'll take my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.70,0:35:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不跑回你爸爸怀中去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go run to daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potestas inferna, me confirma.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.90,0:35:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potestas inferna, me confirma.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.33,0:35:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potestas inferma, me confirma!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.30,0:35:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  迪恩啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, dean, dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.00,0:35:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是太失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.53,0:35:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过我什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had such promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.66,0:36:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你们的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.86,0:36:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们这些家伙在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you guys waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.73,0:36:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找安娜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  除非你们怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.26,0:37:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  在我看来都结束了  废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it looks over to me, junkless.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.40,0:37:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.53,0:37:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算太坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.13,0:37:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事让你耽搁了这么久才来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.23,0:37:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉因为和恶魔交易所以来迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late with the demon delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.30,0:37:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是受了点折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only being tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.16,0:37:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不称赞你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.93,0:37:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们这一次都聚到了一块儿  天使和恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing them all together all at once -- angels and demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真他妈的是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a damn good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.46,0:37:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  当哥斯拉和巨蛾都追着你不放的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, when you got godzilla and mothra on your ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.14,0:37:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想摆脱他们的最好方式就是让他们互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best to get out of their way and let them fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你现在是在放马后炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, now you're just bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.10,0:37:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我猜她现在应该是个一流的天使了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I guess she's some big-time angel now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.70,0:37:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定很高兴  无论她在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be happy... wherever she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.26,0:37:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.55,0:38:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.21,0:38:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你听到他说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.41,0:38:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.75,0:38:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.95,0:38:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.68,0:38:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于我的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how I had promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.91,0:38:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.25,0:38:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不好奇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.31,0:38:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我好奇得要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm damn curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.48,0:38:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你如果不想和我我谈地狱的事  我不会逼你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not talking about hell, and I'm not pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.51,0:38:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不止四个月  你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't four months, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.75,0:38:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.05,0:38:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在人间是四个月  但是在那下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was four months up here, but down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.81,0:39:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚  时间和这里完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. time's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.11,0:39:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就像是有四十年那么长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was more like 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.85,0:39:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.48,0:39:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用各种方式将我扒皮  钻心  拆骨直到  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They sliced and carved and tore at me in ways that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.58,0:39:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我粉碎殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}...until there was nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.01,0:39:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是之后  刹那间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又毫发无伤的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be whole again...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.71,0:39:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像魔术一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.45,0:39:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着他们又会再次重复这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so they could start in all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.68,0:39:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And alastair...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.05,0:39:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在每一天结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.68,0:39:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一次结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.91,0:39:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他都会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.25,0:39:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他开出了个条件能让我离开行刑台\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he would make me an offer to take me off the rack...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.85,0:40:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我去抓那些灵魂放到行刑台\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I put souls on...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.75,0:40:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我来折磨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}...if I started the torturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而每一天  我都告诉他我会坚持到新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every day, I told him to stick it where the sun shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.65,0:40:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整整30年来  我都这样跟他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 30 years, I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我无法再忍受了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I couldn't do it anymore, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法忍受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.81,0:40:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我离开了那个行刑台\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got off that rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.15,0:40:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝给予了帮助  我可以远离那一切了  而则我开始折磨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me, I got right off it, and I started ripping them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.01,0:40:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不记得了我折磨过多少灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost count of how many souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.48,0:40:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这就是我对他们干过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the things that I did to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.55,0:41:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.05,0:41:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  听着  你坚持了30年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, you held out for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.08,0:41:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能像你一样坚持那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's longer than anyone would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.28,0:41:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.65,0:41:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.45,0:41:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.81,0:41:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望不再记得那些  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I couldn't feel anything, sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.21,0:41:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我不再记得那该死的每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I couldn't feel a damn thing.
